### ✅ **Features Implemented:**

- 2 players
- 30 health, 0 mana initially
- 20 damage cards with mana costs
- 3 initial cards in hand
- Randomly chosen active player
- Mana slots and refilling
- Damage and health tracking
- Minions with health and damage
- Minion turn order and defense
- Minion sleep and use
- Minion vs. Minion combat
- Attack vs. Minion (no defense)
- Minion removal when health drops to 0

